# Project context

**workshop-app** — Next.js 16 App Router demo for the Docker Sandboxes workshop (WeAreDevelopers Berlin).

## Routes (this app)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `/` | Home |
| `/labs` | Redirects to platform |
| `/about` | About the workshop |

Register, login, profile, questions, and admin → **platform** via `NEXT_PUBLIC_PLATFORM_URL` (see `src/lib/platform.ts`).

## Key files

- `src/lib/workshop-data.ts` — lab metadata, copy, links
- `src/lib/site-config.ts` — `platformUrl()`, nav items
- `src/components/layout/` — header, footer, page shell
- `src/components/ui/` — shadcn/ui + Apple design tokens

## Dev

```bash
npm run dev    # predev runs sync-dev-env demo script
npm run build
npm run lint
```

Default: http://localhost:3000. Platform: https://nextjs-26f1-3000.prg1.zerops.app
